WEBVTT

00:12:27.958 --> 00:12:30.893
And the more women
demand this information,

00:12:30.917 --> 00:12:34.309
the sooner we'll be able to break
the taboos around menopause,

00:12:34.333 --> 00:12:37.226
and also come up with solutions
that actually work,

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:38.851
not just for Alzheimer's disease,

00:12:38.875 --> 00:12:41.559
but for women's brain health as a whole.

00:12:41.583 --> 00:12:44.268
Brain health is women's health.

00:12:44.292 --> 00:12:45.559
Thank you.

00:12:45.583 --> 00:12:47.518
(Applause)

00:12:47.542 --> 00:12:48.809
Thank you.

00:12:48.833 --> 00:12:50.083
Oh, thank you.